pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  讲解建议：不回避问题。每个问题按“根因—对策—目标”讲，明确这是可控、可改善的结构性问题。
elements:
  - elementId: page-marker
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [872, 36, 28, 28]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [872, 36, 28, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "04"

  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 38, 500, 24]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 04 · 问题与风险

  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 66, 840, 46]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 两个结构性问题，必须在上半年解决

  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 26]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 问题均有明确根因与对策；建议以季度为节点跟踪关闭，Q2结束时进行半年度复判。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: zone-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 318, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: zone-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 500, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: issue-1-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 170, 90, 120]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 44
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, top]
      text: "01"

  - elementId: issue-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 172, 732, 38]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 华东续约率 78%，低于目标 7 个百分点

  - elementId: issue-1-cause
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 216, 732, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>根因</strong>：交付资源错配，客户成功覆盖率仅 42%；续约风险集中在年合同额 50 万元以下客户。</p>

  - elementId: issue-1-action
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 252, 732, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>对策</strong>：客户成功团队由 3 人扩至 8 人；6月底前完成 Top 40 客户健康度复盘，Q2 续约率目标 82%。</p>

  - elementId: issue-2-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 340, 90, 120]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 44
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, top]
      text: "02"

  - elementId: issue-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 342, 732, 38]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 新客获客成本 CAC 回升至 1.9 万元，同比 +32%

  - elementId: issue-2-cause
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 386, 732, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>根因</strong>：线索质量下降，付费渠道贡献过度集中在单一来源，自然线索占比持续走低。</p>

  - elementId: issue-2-action
    elementType: text
    bounds: [168, 422, 732, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>对策</strong>：重建内容获客与伙伴转介绍体系；Q2 单客户 CAC 目标 ≤1.6 万元，付费渠道占比压降至 60% 以下。</p>
